{"parentUuid":"7975f988-19b8-4701-bc23-2ea2a4cbe26a","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0e75e1c2-9f84-43c4-8006-cccad7102c77","agentId":"a11c0a040e3cf682b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017c6Sjm8XbhWa65vDtaisdE","type":"tool_result","content":"      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/bgagent\n  codex:\n    docs:\n      - https://developers.openai.com/codex/hooks#common-input-fields\n    runs:\n      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/background-agent\n    deviations:\n      - adr: capability-grounding\n        statement: >-\n          Codex's spawn_agent has no foreground or background choice: it\n          always answers at once with a receipt (the sub-agent's id and a\n          nickname) and the sub-agent runs concurrently with the turn, its\n          hooks firing under the same session id with an agent_id and an\n          agent_type (recorded: runs/background-agent).\n      - adr: modeled-surface\n        statement: >-\n          The mock runs the sub-agent on its own thread and rollout with the\n          scenario script, and stops one still running when the run ends. A\n          hook's refusal of the spawn, and the sub-agent's states after\n          pending_init, are not modelled.\n  cursor:\n    docs:\n      - https://cursor.com/docs/hooks#subagentstart\n    runs:\n      - cursor-mock/snapshots/runs/background-agent\n    deviations:\n      - adr: modeled-surface\n        statement: >-\n          Once its turn is over, a non-interactive run waits for the\n          sub-agent and reports its end in a task_notification frame; real\n          Cursor then gives the agent a further turn to handle it, which the\n          mock does not. Only a Task call that asks for the background is\n          modelled, a hook's refusal of it is not, and the mock's sub-agent\n          runs the scenario script with the task's prompt.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"e114920c-3ef2-4a7d-a381-9f4c563bad6b","timestamp":"2026-10-03T16:39:21.171Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"7975f988-19b8-4701-bc23-2ea2a4cbe26a","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a11c0a040e3cf682b","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
